Package: authClient
Type: Package
Title: Shared Authentication and SSO Client for Shiny Apps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Ehnes", email = "danielehnes@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared user authentication, DB-backed single sign-on sessions,
    and per-app access checks against a central identity database.
    Any Shiny app can depend on this package to authenticate its users and
    check whether they are allowed to use that app, without pulling in the
    admin console UI.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
